     no la nhanh `else` cua mot dieu kien SONG (tam khong co cot 7) va la dung khuon ban
     mobile dang chay — khach giao ban SACH la dung ngay. */
  .hm-hero-veil-tall {
    height: 260px;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, .55) 0, rgba(0, 0, 0, .55) 160px, transparent 100%);
  }
  /* KHOI NUT TREN TAM CO CHU NUONG. `left`/`top` do markup cap theo % (xem HM_HERO), nen o
     day chi khai phan khong doi. KHONG dung `.hm-hero-copy`: khoi do la hop 1440 canh giua
     cho chu HTML, con nut nay phai bam theo chu NAM TRONG ANH tuc theo % cua chinh anh. */
  .hm-hero-cta { position: absolute; z-index: 2; pointer-events: none; }
  .hm-hero-cta button { pointer-events: auto; }
  /* KHOI CHU TRONG ANH (08/09/2026, lenh user: tieu de + CTA "Discover now" tren banner).
     LE TRAI KHONG PHAI MOT CON SO CO DINH: hero la khoi TRAN VIEN (nam ngoai khung
     max-w-[1440px]), nen `left: 40px` se dan chu vao sat mep MAN HINH o kho 1920 — lech han
     khoi cot noi dung cua ca trang. Cach dung o day la mot hop 1440 canh giua giong khung
     noi dung, roi dem 40 vao trong:
       o 1440 -> chu cach mep anh 40, dung bang padding-left cua .hm-spot-copy;
       o 1920 -> chu o 280, tuc gan sat mep cot noi dung 1440 (264) chu khong theo mep man.
     `bottom: 48` chu khong 16: hang cham o day 16 va vung bam cua no cao 32 (::before inset
