                   Muon giu 1920/720 thi doi rule nay VA them '50% 0%' — hero thap lai 159px
                   o kho 1440, doi lai mat 23% day anh. Mot dong, noi la toi doi.
                   Ghi nguyen 2057/1000 chu khong rut gon: day la SPEC ANH, de nguyen thi doc
