  /* BAN CHUAN SPACING/TYPO — LOP BAT THEO TAB NU (11/09/2026, lenh user: "homepage nu la day
     desktop.html nhung bat qua tab nu"). Tu 09/09 hai nganh dung chung MOT screen home (nhanh
